# The whole Material Symbols Rounded font (~15 MB) that builds before the generated symbol fonts
# downloaded here; no longer used, but an old checkout may still hold it. The library's
# fetchSymbolFontSources task warns while it exists, since anything in assets/ ships.
/library/src/main/assets/fonts/MaterialSymbolsRounded.ttf

